WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.299 --> 00:00:11.789
Yo what’s good son? This week on
Thug Notes we separating wheat from chaff

00:00:11.789 --> 00:00:17.420
with The Crucible by Arthur Miller.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:21.310
Things ain’t right up in 1692
Massachusetts where Reverand Parris’s baby

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:27.159
girl Betty in bed straight clocked out. See,
last night Parris peeped Betty freakin all

00:00:27.159 --> 00:00:32.720
pagan-like with her cousin Abigail and slave
Tituba, and now word on the street is witchraft

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:37.010
be involved- and the uptight peeps of Salem
ain’t havin none of that.

00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:41.489
When the play’s hero John Proctor
rolls in to see what’s what, Abigail gets

00:00:41.489 --> 00:00:44.739
all up on his baby- maker like ugly on yo
mama.

00:00:44.739 --> 00:00:49.769
Apparently, Abigail used to be Proctor’s
maid but got her ass tossed out when Proctor’s

00:00:49.769 --> 00:00:53.170
wife
Elizabeth found her shining more than Proctor’s

00:00:53.170 --> 00:00:55.429
shoes. Straight scandalous!

00:00:55.429 --> 00:00:59.160
Even though Proctor been doggin
Abigail since then, she still think that if

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:02.399
Elizabeth was outta the picture, she’d be
his new wifey.

00:01:02.399 --> 00:01:07.240
Later, word come that homies gettin
accused of witchcraft left and right. Turns

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:12.090
out, Abigail playin dirty and say Elizabeth
been sippin dat witches joose. So the fuzz

00:01:12.090 --> 00:01:15.980
get all up in the Proctor’s grill and throw
her ass behind bars.

00:01:15.980 --> 00:01:20.640
So Proctor busts in to court and try to free
his boo, but all dat real talk backfires and

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:24.760
gets his ass thrown in the big house. And
the only way out is by lying and

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:27.470
admitting that he part of the devil’s posse.

00:01:27.470 --> 00:01:31.840
Proctor keeps it OG and don’t play
dat game til he gets a visit from his dip

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:36.650
Elizabeth. And eventually he decides to fess
up to something he ain’t even do.

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:39.570
When the law start sayin that they
gonna need a written confession so they can

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:44.490
show all the hood, Proctor says “Hell naw!”
Cuz he ain’t gonna let them use his name

00:01:44.490 --> 00:01:49.950
on the street like dat. So he tears that sh**
up, struts up to the gallows, and goes out

00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:51.970
like a gangsta.

00:01:55.270 --> 00:01:59.870
Not only is this play flowin bout events that
really took place way back when, but Miller

00:01:59.870 --> 00:02:02.990
also pimpin
some parable up in here. See, Miller wanted

00:02:02.990 --> 00:02:08.640
to give a big “fu** you” to 1950s McCarthyism-
a time when a whole bunch of Americans started

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:13.060
pointin fingers at they own peeps in the name
of tryin to sniff out any commies.

00:02:13.060 --> 00:02:17.670
And in Miller’s mind, those snitch
Americans only know guilty and not guilty.

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:24.670
Like he say-

00:02:27.090 --> 00:02:35.820
See the problem up in here is
peoples always viewing things in extremes.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:39.569
To them, it’s all black and white which
means that if something ain’t of God, then

00:02:39.569 --> 00:02:41.140
it must be of the devil.

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:45.540
So what starts out as political
opposites turns in to moral opposites. Dem

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:50.150
crooked right wingers have made it so that
Capitalists are all holy, and communists ain’t

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:51.890
nothing but devil worshippers.

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:55.410
But it ain’t just political power
plays people trying to pawn. Sometimes

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:58.780
you just gotta stab a brutha in the back,
but dress it up like you doin the world a

00:02:58.790 --> 00:02:59.810
favor.

00:03:06.980 --> 00:03:11.319
What you know bout this play’s
title, partner? According to Martine, a crucible

00:03:11.319 --> 00:03:15.870
is a severe test, obviously referrin to the
raw grind Proctor beastin through. And if

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:20.230
you wanna keep it mad literal, a crucible
also used to melt away all da chanky bullsh**

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:25.230
on a piece of metal til all that’s left
is pure, uncut, top-grade steel.

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:28.760
So is the play saying that Proctor
is the purity that comes out of all this crooked

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:34.000
ass mess? Are we supposed to put it all on
the line for our beliefs? Maybe. But truth

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:38.810
is, John’s death doesn’t prove nothing
to nobody. You best not forget what Reverand

00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:41.670
Hale say to Elizabeth in the last act of 

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:42.370
the play:

00:03:53.340 --> 00:04:00.340
Don’t be a playa hater, get yo’self
some Thug Notes swag and tell yo mama to subscribe.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:03.281
Peace playas!

